== Overview ==
'''Quad-Blade Strider Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] that appears in [[Nightmare Mode]]. It can stun towers with its blades and will stun them for around 10 seconds. It is also a fast enemy.
== Appearance ==
The Quad Blade Strider Toilet Is a toilet with a gray welder's helmet along with 4 blades and 3 legs. It has a light gray toilet that has a small bowl.
== Waves ==
==== Nightmare Mode ====
Wave 40: x1

Wave 44: x1
== Health ==
=== Nightmare Mode ===
Wave 40: 479,000 HP

Wave 44: 521,500 HP

== Strategy ==
You should use high DPS units to defeat this. [[Medic Cameraman]] is also recommended to heal stuns. [[Camera Repair Drone]] works too. It also has a lot of health so you should use high DPS units.

== Trivia ==

* It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Malformed_Strider_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Malformed Strider Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
* In the series, this toilet is bigger than the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Titan_Cameraman#Upgraded_Titan_Cameraman_(2.0) Upgraded Titan Cameraman], but it is very small in-game.
